          "message": {
            "text": "No access control or authentication requirement for MCP tools exposing workspace graph and drift data. Add a requirement specifying that MCP tool endpoints must authenticate callers (e.g., via a shared secret, token, or OS-level restriction) and that only principals with explicit workspace-read permission may invoke read tools; only principals with workspace-write permission may invoke commands that write files or trigger drift runs."
